      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">A Gay Mess (What Are the New Leaders of the Rebellion...?)</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;Glimmer worries about trying to go five minutes without being gay and snuggling with Adora. Which sheâ€™ll have to do soon, in front of everyone, somehow. Luckily Adora is here to kiss her fears away!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No they donâ€™t see the irony to this. Theyâ€™re busy. With the gay.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Iâ€™m sure theyâ€™ll be fine.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
