          <rdf:li>More Fluff</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>Rated teen for many many smooches and snuggles</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>also i think i let glimmer think a swear word at somepoint as a treat</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>short appearances of Mermista and Bow and a few others</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>mermista is thirsty</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>adora is feeling that 'wow my girlfriend? Flawless' mood</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>meanwhile glimmer is trying glimmer is dying she's hopeless and gay and thriving</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>There's no plot</rdf:li>
